  id: "global", name: "Global Perspectives", icon: "🧭", color: "#0891b2",
  overview: "Stage 8 Global Perspectives builds six skills - Research, Analysis, Evaluation, Reflection, Communication and Collaboration - through real-world issues such as climate change, water, migration, trade and the digital world. You learn to find and judge sources, separate facts from opinions, explain causes and consequences, compare local, national and global perspectives and propose reasoned solutions. These are exactly the skills tested at the Stage 9 Checkpoint, so mastering them in Stage 8 gives you a strong head start.",
